{"unit_id":"nianchen8__dsh-skill-panel#feature-1","repo":"nianchen8/dsh-skill-panel","commit":"dd30a0417741548502e4c08b19c2aa2270062edc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skill-panel 的功能「技能目录浏览」：面板列出会话可见的技能及名称、描述和来源，并支持搜索和来源筛选。可从设置页或侧边栏打开。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:273-334","client.js:757-763","client.js:977-1008"]}
{"unit_id":"nianchen8__dsh-skill-panel#feature-2","repo":"nianchen8/dsh-skill-panel","commit":"dd30a0417741548502e4c08b19c2aa2270062edc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skill-panel 的功能「查看技能详情」：展开技能条目后读取详情，展示 whenToUse、路径和技能正文。正文读取上限为 50000 个字符。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:336-349","client.js:730-753"]}
